,,"The original code failed to check if the bid exceeded the player's available cash, allowing invalid bids. The fixed code adds a condition to the while loop to ensure bids do not exceed the player's cash and provides feedback to the user if they attempt to bid too much. This improvement prevents illegal bids and enhances user experience by clearly communicating bid limits."

